  "title": "Rocket Lab Awarded Record $266M Missile Defense Contract with U.S. Space Force for Suborbital Launches",
  "summary": "LONG BEACH, Calif., July 27, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Rocket Lab Corporation (Nasdaq: RKLB), a global leader in launch services and space systems today announced it has been awarded its largest launch contract to date, a $266 million multi-launch contract with the U.S. Space Force.",
